sequenceDiagram
  participant Analyst
  participant Case
  participant Supervisor
  participant Approval
  participant Execution
  Analyst->>Case: Investigate and link safe evidence
  Analyst->>Approval: Request minimum reversible scope
  Supervisor->>Approval: Independent approve / reject
  Approval->>Execution: Time-bound scoped grant
  Execution->>Execution: Freeze, scope, idempotency, concurrency checks
  Execution-->>Case: Sanitized outcome
  Supervisor->>Execution: Separate rollback request when eligible
  Execution->>Execution: Divergence check and rollback
